XCXq3GWB7oj056jdaYfhu9Oawjm_Dcydy6R0ApjjRS36dOJ0M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH-ZUmsi_nRa3yin4MBvLBjFJjXgzoGiPQIcAqUQSBZKg&oe=6A8D9701"}, "display_name": "Mind Mines", "keywords": ["art", "halo", "jigsaw", "puzzles", "minesweeper"], "long_description": "Mind Mines is a pioneering jigsaw puzzle game that transforms over 190 pieces of artwork into interactive jigsaw challenges\u2014each infused with strategic mine detection and logical decision-making.\n\nThis isn\u2019t just about fitting pieces together. Every move tests your reasoning: uncover hidden traps, avoid mistakes, and mine your way to  completion. Carefully observe and place\u2014but beware: too many wrong moves could trigger mines and end your session.\n\nUse intuitive hand gestures to navigate between solving, scanning, and neutralizing threats. Each puzzle offers a unique interplay between visual intuition and logical problem-solving\u2014merging artistic appreciation with cognitive challenge.\n\nStep into Mind Mines\u2014and challenge both sides of your brain.", "short_description": "A jigsaw puzzle game where art meets logic. Explore 190+ artworks while solving strategic jigsaw puzzles with hidden traps. Mine with your mind\u2014one piece at a time."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "991603876464073", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "\u30de\u30a4\u30f3\u30c9\u30fb\u30de\u30a4\u30f3\u30ba", "keywords": ["\u30a2\u30fc\u30c8", "\u7d75\u753b", "\u30d8\u30a4\u30ed\u30fc", "\u30b8\u30b0\u30bd\u30fc\u30d1\u30ba\u30eb", "\u30de\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30a4\u30fc\u30d1\u30fc"], "long_description": "Mind Mines\uff08\u30de\u30a4\u30f3\u30c9\u30fb\u30de\u30a4\u30f3\u30ba\uff09\u306f\u3001190\u70b9\u4ee5\u4e0a\u306e\u30a2\u30fc\u30c8\u4f5c\u54c1\u3092\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30e9\u30af\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6\u306a\u30b8\u30b0\u30bd\u30fc\u30d1\u30ba\u30eb\u3078\u3068\u5909\u63db\u3057\u305f\u3001\u5148\u99c6\u76